后处理层，通过从历史数据中学习现有预报模型的错误并修正其输出，将两周到六周范围的预报准确率翻倍。该模型在ECMWF的季节间预报竞赛中获第一名，首次在该时间范围内稳定超过气候学平均值，并显著改善洪水、寒潮等极端天气事件的预测；模型开源、低成本、可附加于任意预报模型，肯尼亚气象部门已接洽用于改进季风季预报。","title":"MIT团队用机器学习修正误差，将两到六周天气预报准确率翻倍","title_en":"Researchers improve weather forecasts looking two to six weeks out","url":"https://news.mit.edu/2026/researchers-improve-weather-forecasts-looking-two-six-weeks-out-1014"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ooiqiluy56g21ir2u4phxjqu7","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"ooiqiluy56g21ir2u4phxjqu7","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ooiqiluy56g21ir2u4phxjqu7","published_at":"2026-10-14T12:50:00Z","ref":"A10","score":69,"selected":true,"source":"Lovable Blog","summary":"Lovable 推出增长工具，在原有建应用聊天窗口中提供增长计划、广告投放和 SEO 能力。用户设定目标后，Lovable 依据应用上下文生成可执行计划；可连接 Google Ads 和 Meta 账号在 Google。","title":"Lovable 推出增长工具，从同一聊天窗口帮你获客投广告和做 SEO","title_en":"From building your app to growing it: Lovable now helps you find customers","url":"https://lovable.dev/blog/introducing-growth-tools"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/s27ozk3mqeklm58sqxjeaz2wk","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"s27ozk3mqeklm58sqxjeaz2wk","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/s27ozk3mqeklm58sqxjeaz2wk","published_at":"2026-10-14T11:30:00Z","ref":"A11","score":61,"selected":true,"source":"Databricks：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Databricks 演示通过系统性性能优化，将 Qwen 3.8 27B 在 AI Runtime 上的微调时间从 7 小时 44 分钟降至 1 小时 17 分钟，提速 6 倍。","title":"Databricks 讲解如何在 AI Runtime 上将 Qwen 3.8 27B 微调时间缩短 6 倍","title_en":"Reducing Qwen training time by 6x on AI Runtime","url":"https://www.databricks.com/blog/reducing-qwen-training-time-6x-ai-runtime"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/wn2lwzshkg8gt2sbjuj1qxd8y","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"wn2lwzshkg8gt2sbjuj1qxd8y","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/wn2lwzshkg8gt2sbjuj1qxd8y","published_at":"2026-10-14T07:00:00Z","ref":"A12","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI Developers：Blog（网页）","summary":"OpenAI C